  Baseline coverage 90.224%, precision 98.368%.
  'ok/wrong'  correct auto-closes given up per wrong posting caught.
  'pts/pt'    points of coverage surrendered per point of precision gained.
  'bnd'       wrong postings of undetermined drift, caught incidentally; real
              errors, but not evidence about the blind spot either way.

  For scale: this project refused the digit-run filter at 31.4 points per point
